  ],
  "description": "Roland service notes, 15 December 1983, first edition. NJM4558S factory option represented by the JRC4558 model. Engaged circuit as drawn for the HM-2 main and volume boards. Three active gyrators share the two Color Mix controls. The 250 kΩ D-taper Distortion control uses an audio-law approximation and the 10 kΩ G-taper Color controls use linear travel. The 1S188FM germanium dead-zone pair uses 1N34A, the 1S2473 silicon devices use 1N4148, and a 100 MΩ resistance references the series clipping junction. Q1 2SK30A-Y, Q7 2SA970-GR and Q2/Q3 2SC732TM-GR use 2N5457, 2N3906 and 2SC2240 equivalents. Q4 and Q10 are 60 Ω in the engaged path, with dry-buffer loading retained. Indicator, latching and adapter switching are omitted.",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Level",
      "Color Mix Low",
      "Color Mix High",
      "Distortion"
    ]
  },
  "name": "Boss HM-2 Heavy Metal",
